# Credentials. None of these belong in a repository, and this one is public.
#
# The APNs key signs push for every app on the team, and the Firebase service
# account can send as the shop. Both are uploaded to a console once by hand —
# neither is read by the app or needed to build it.
*.p8
AuthKey_*.p8
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/google-services.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
serviceAccount*.json
*.pem
*.mobileprovision
